  "prefLabel": "Ins 2901.04 Judicial Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2901.04 Judicial Review. Any order or decision of the commissioner shall be subject to review in accordance with RSA 541 at the instance of any party to the proceedings whose interests are substantially affected.\n\nSource. #8919, eff 7-1-07; ss by #9934, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12748, eff 6-1-19",
